# Reference data and availability (FR-7, FR-10).
# Run with the VS Code "REST Client" extension (humao.rest-client): click "Send Request" above a request.
# Needs a running API with seed data: `docker compose --profile app up --build` (see README › Try it).

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
# "Tomorrow" in the dealerships' time zone. All three are UTC+7 with no daylight saving, so that's
# the UTC date of (now + 7 h + 1 day). The seed puts its demo appointments on this day.
@day = {{$datetime 'YYYY-MM-DD' 31 h}}

@bangkok = 10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001
@hanoi = 10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003
@oilChange = 40000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001
@transmission = 40000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000007

### Health: 200 {"status":"ok","db":"up"}
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Dealerships (cursor pagination, newest first)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/dealerships

### Next page: copy meta.nextCursor from the response above
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/dealerships?limit=1

### One dealership + the service types it supports (Hanoi: no EV or transmission work, BR-6)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/dealerships/{{hanoi}}

### Service types and durations (end = start + duration, BR-1)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/service-types

### Availability: Bangkok oil changes tomorrow, every 15 minutes from opening (A-9, A-14)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/dealerships/{{bangkok}}/availability?serviceTypeId={{oilChange}}&date={{day}}

### Availability: Hanoi oil changes tomorrow. 10:00 is missing: the only bay is taken by a demo appointment.
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/dealerships/{{hanoi}}/availability?serviceTypeId={{oilChange}}&date={{day}}

### Availability: Bangkok transmission repair tomorrow. Decha, the only qualified technician, is busy
### 09:00-10:30, so on a fresh stack the first start is 10:30 (13:30 once booking scenario 5 has run).
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/dealerships/{{bangkok}}/availability?serviceTypeId={{transmission}}&date={{day}}

### Availability for a service Hanoi can't do: 422 SERVICE_TYPE_NOT_SUPPORTED
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/dealerships/{{hanoi}}/availability?serviceTypeId={{transmission}}&date={{day}}

### Invalid input: 400 VALIDATION_FAILED with details[] per field
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/dealerships/not-a-uuid/availability?serviceTypeId=x&date=tomorrow
